{"id":1296,"name":"Isekai Shokudou","slug":"isekai_shokudou","synopsis":"At the bottom floor of the building with a dog signboard, in the shopping district near the office street, there lies a cafeteria called 'Youshoku no Nekoya'. Open for fifty years and has satisfied the various salarymen from nearby offices. Despite it being called a Western cuisine cafeteria, it also provides other varieties of menus. For the people of this certain world, it’s their one-and-only special cafeteria.\n\nThere is, however, one secret to 'Nekoya.' The cafeteria is closed to the public every Saturday in order to make way for special guests. \n\n\n(Source: Official site)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2017,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:58","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:32:37","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":34012},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":97617},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":12535},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":12385},{"site":"ANN","externalId":19479},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8071},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"AMAZON_PRIME_VIDEO","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":80993368}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2583,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/ZihC2yWrXOZA8xNoaWrVxvHgbCGQE8SNRSsEgmNW.jpg"},{"id":2584,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/GbvErOBWlSV92d1sYsJDJ08sGVcey2ktmYuXtSmH.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":59,"name":"SILVER LINK.","slug":"silver_link"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":417,"name":"Isekai Shokudou","slug":"isekai_shokudou"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":7531,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":7532,"title":"One In A Billion","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":8818,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":8387,"basename":"IsekaiShokudou-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"IsekaiShokudou-OP1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/IsekaiShokudou-